    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n102185" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ταινίδιον</span></b> , τό, 
			Dim. of
		
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ταινία</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>strip of linen</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Acut.</u>
			</span></i>(<u>Sp.</u>)<i><span class="en">
				15
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Sor.
				<u>Fasc.</u>
				36
			</span></i>, al.; <i>strip of skin</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Heliod.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Orib.
				45.5.3
			</span></i>, Antyll.ib.<i><span class="en">
				45.26.1
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				Dim. of
			
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ταινία</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					111
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PMich.Zen.</u>
				38.8
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii B.C.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b> perh. <i>small jewel-case</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δακτύλιος χρυσοῦς ἐν -ίῳ ἐνδεδεμένος
					ξυλίνῳ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IG</u>
					11(2).161
				</span></i>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>B</u>
				51
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				119
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				203
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>B</u>
				68
			</span></i> (Delos, <span class="entity">iii B.C.</span>); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στλεγγίδιον χρυσοῦν ἐπὶ ταινιδίῳ</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				82
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				91
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὅρμος χρυσοῦς ἐπὶ ταινιδίου</span>”
